  "honest_limits": [
    "This is a face and landmark signal pack, not a talking-head generator or an end-to-end lip-sync model.",
    "It cannot recognize character identity; identity locking must come from the product runtime.",
    "The synthetic replay is one flat stylized avatar and is not representative of arbitrary games, cameras, skin tones, helmets, facial hair, head poses, lighting, or occlusions.",
    "The guarded landmark p95 fits a 15 fps source frame, but detector reacquisition p95 does not fit 30 fps.",
    "Mouth ROI area jitter is high and requires smoothing plus a conservative dynamic residual mask.",
    "The replay is silent, so audiovisual onset, skew, phoneme accuracy, and rendered mouth quality were not measured.",
    "The CPU path consumes approximately one logical core; real game frame-rate impact remains unmeasured.",
    "An unguarded tracker confidently placed mouth landmarks on the CLOSE SIMULATION button; the appearance latch is mandatory, not optional."
  ],
